abstract: "AI Foundations | Self-Location Registry defines and operates the intake, authority-checking, validation, registration, and indexing layer through which public Index Manifests become searchable entries pointing to canonical Self-Location Records without transferring authorship, ownership, source status, or authority to the registry. It preserves Alyssa Solen as author and source."

